OL,3,ADrought and hosepipe bans remain
OL,4,Adespite wettest week since early
OL,5,AFebruary
OL,6,
OL,7,FIn the last few days of August and
OL,8,Fstart of September, more rain fell than
OL,9,Fany other week since early February,
OL,10,Faccording to the Environment Agency.
OL,12,FDespite the change to more unsettled
OL,13,Fand wetter conditions, all of Wales and
OL,14,Fmost of England remains in drought.
OL,16,FAnd water companies are reminding
OL,17,Fcustomers that temporary hosepipe bans
OL,18,Fare still in force despite the rainfall
OL,19,Fand decreased demand with the cooler
OL,20,Fweather.
OL,23,APub: 08-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG7/39
OL,24,ANext PageB Nat NewsC Nat TVF Clean Feed
